<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66148" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλλ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>being about to do, threatening to do</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.126
			</span></i>, al.; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρμή</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1393a4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unfulfilled thought</i> or <i>intention, delay</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.116
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				723d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ βραχείας μελλήσεως</span>
			at short <i>notice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.66
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελλήσει οὐδεμιᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procop.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					1.25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen. rei,
				<i>putting off</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τὴν ἐκείνων μέλλησιν τῶν ἐς
					ἡμᾶς δεινῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.12
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
